# A Hard Day's Knight with its era module (modules/era/lua/quests/otherareas/a_hard_days_knight.lua, enabled by its
# condition xi.pre(xi.expansion.SOA): RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_SOA 0): its onServerStart override removes
# quest.sections[3] (table.remove), the completed section, so the Temple Knight Key cannot be had. Completed (a GM) with
# both crest keys: Quelveuiat's trigger: no section: his default 122; both keys traded: no trade handler, nothing; the
# keys kept. The available and accepted sections are the quest's own (the main flow).
module modules/era/lua/quests/otherareas/a_hard_days_knight.lua
lists TavnazianSafehold/Quelveuiat/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Quelveuiat/onTrade TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/631 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/632
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=4.3,-22.75,-25.9 job=WAR lvl=75
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
quest OtherAreas.AHardDaysKnight completed
item SealionCrestKey
item CoralCrestKey
login
trigger Quelveuiat                      # completed: the section removed: 122 (not 631)
finish
trade Quelveuiat SealionCrestKey x1 CoralCrestKey x1 # no trade handler: nothing; the keys kept
